        {
          "id": "sh1-e9",
          "type": "TEACH",
          "title": "Ich suche einen Mantel.",
          "body": "With **suchen** (to look for), **möchten** and **haben**, the clothes are the **object**. Remember: only *der* words change, *ein* → **einen** and *der* → **den**.\n\n- *Ich suche **einen** Mantel.* (der Mantel)\n- *Ich suche **eine** Jacke.* (die Jacke)\n- *Ich suche **ein** Kleid.* (das Kleid)",
