        {
          "id": "sh2-e9",
          "type": "TEACH",
          "title": "Das gefällt mir.",
          "body": "**Das gefällt mir.** = I like it. (Literally: *That pleases me.*) Use it for things you see, like clothes, a flat or a town. Learn it as a fixed phrase.\n\n- **Das gefällt mir nicht.** = I don't like it.\n- **Das gefällt mir sehr gut!** = I really like it!\n\nThe *ä* in *gefällt* sounds like the *e* in *bed*.",
